{"id":"7aafa519603f2c09","group":"57","path":"57/57-cor-ls-uncountable.md","title":"Lowenheim-Skolem Uncountable Corollary","display":"cor-ls-uncountable — Lowenheim-Skolem Uncountable Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-cor-ls-uncountable","aliases":["57-cor-ls-uncountable"],"display":"cor-ls-uncountable — Lowenheim-Skolem Uncountable Corollary","depends_on":["[[57-df-first-order-language]]","[[57-thm-ls-upward]]","[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-cor-ls-uncountable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-cor-ls-uncountable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-ls-uncountable — Lowenheim-Skolem Uncountable Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"246ebb0467f65731\" href=\"?note=246ebb0467f65731\" title=\"57-thm-ls-upward\">57-thm-ls-upward</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a7a345348b1a1d3a\" href=\"?note=a7a345348b1a1d3a\" title=\"57-df-cardinal\">57-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (签名, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (基数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a7a345348b1a1d3a\" href=\"?note=a7a345348b1a1d3a\" title=\"57-df-cardinal\">57-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ls\\text{-}uncountable} \\vdash ((\\kappa \\geq \\max(\\aleph_0, |S|, |T|)) \\land \\exists \\mathfrak{B}\\,(\\mathfrak{B} \\models T \\land |B| \\geq \\aleph_0)) \\to \\exists \\mathfrak{A}\\,(\\mathfrak{A} \\models T \\land |A| = \\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ls\\text{-}uncountable} \\vdash ((\\kappa \\geq \\max(\\aleph_0, |S|, |T|)) \\land \\exists \\mathfrak{B}\\,(\\mathfrak{B} \\models T \\land |B| \\geq \\aleph_0)) \\to \\exists \\mathfrak{A}\\,(\\mathfrak{A} \\models T \\land |A| = \\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>If a theory <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> has an infinite model, then it has models of every cardinality <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa \\geq |T| + \\aleph_0\">\\(\\kappa \\geq |T| + \\aleph_0\\)</span>. Note: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|T|\">\\(|T|\\)</span> denotes the cardinality of the theory (number of sentences).</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-thm-ls-upward","status":"resolved","id":"246ebb0467f65731","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-thm-ls-upward]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"a7a345348b1a1d3a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (签名, see [[57-df-first-order-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S$ (理论, see [[57-df-theory]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"a7a345348b1a1d3a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (基数, see [[57-df-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ls\\text{-}uncountable} \\vdash ((\\kappa \\geq \\max(\\aleph_0, |S|, |T|)) \\land \\exists \\mathfrak{B}\\,(\\mathfrak{B} \\models T \\land |B| \\geq \\aleph_0)) \\to \\exists \\mathfrak{A}\\,(\\mathfrak{A} \\models T \\land |A| = \\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa \\geq |T| + \\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"|T|","display":false}],"bytes":1061,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-354","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-ax-equality-function-substitution]]\n[[57-ax-equality-predicate-substitution]]\n[[57-ax-equality-reflexivity]]\n[[57-ax-equality-term-substitution]]\n[[57-ax-generalization]]\n[[57-ax-hilbert-exists-introduction]]\n[[57-ax-hilbert-forall]]\n[[57-ax-hilbert-forall-instantiation]]\n[[57-ax-hilbert-impl1]]\n[[57-ax-hilbert-impl2]]\n[[57-ax-hilbert-neg]]\n[[57-ax-modus-ponens]]\n[[57-ax-substitution-schema]]\n[[57-cor-coincidence-sentence]]\n[[57-cor-ls-countable]]\n[[57-cor-ls-uncountable]]\n[[57-cor-substitution-simple]]"}],"outgoing":["140b30594fbd26d8","246ebb0467f65731","9c053a73bd2d84c4","c136ba3960a7223a","03dc48eb29950767","a7a345348b1a1d3a"]}